<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:09:01 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>99岁数学家如何解开百年辫子之谜</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/how-a-99yearold-mathematician-unraveled-a-centuryold-braid-mystery</link><description>20 世纪 30 年代，德国数学家维尔纳·布劳 (Werner Burau) 提出了一个扭曲的几何之谜，该谜团将持续近一个世纪。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-a-99yearold-mathematician-unraveled-a-centuryold-braid-mystery.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:08:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/how-a-99yearold-mathematician-unraveled-a-centuryold-braid-mystery</guid></item><item><title>基因疗法逆转小鼠完全先天性夜盲症，改善视力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/gene-therapy-reverses-complete-congenital-night-blindness-in-mice-improving-vision</link><description>一项新的临床前研究表明，基因增强疗法可以恢复严重遗传性夜盲症的视力。这项发表在《基因治疗》杂志上的研究针对的是完全先天性静止性夜盲症（cCSNB），这种疾病的视网膜回路从出生起就无法产生可靠的视觉反应。在小鼠模型中，治疗改善了视网膜功能和视觉表现，为未来的人类治疗提供了有希望的蓝图。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/gene-therapy-reverses-complete-congenital-night-blindness-in-mice-improving-vision2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:53:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/gene-therapy-reverses-complete-congenital-night-blindness-in-mice-improving-vision</guid></item><item><title>曾经被视为噪音的脑电波可以帮助建立现实的生物模型</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/brain-waves-once-seen-as-noise-could-help-build-a-biological-model-of-reality</link><description>你的大脑与海洋有一些令人惊讶的共同点：波浪。电活动冲刷大脑表面，产生所谓的脑行波或神经行波。这些波浪会导致您的行为和注意力发生真正的差异，而且就像海浪一样，可能有多种原因，从内在活动到环境输入。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-waves-once-seen-as-noise-could-help-build-a-biological-model-of-reality.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:38:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/brain-waves-once-seen-as-noise-could-help-build-a-biological-model-of-reality</guid></item><item><title>探索更智能的方式来建设气候适应型道路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/exploring-a-smarter-way-to-build-climate-resilient-roads</link><description>每年六月至九月，印度都会经历季风季节。虽然可见的强降雨往往是许多道路需要比预期更早修复的原因，但早在第一滴雨滴落在道路上之前，一种不太明显但至关重要的力量就在发挥作用。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/exploring-a-smarter-way-to-build-climate-resilient-roads.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:23:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/exploring-a-smarter-way-to-build-climate-resilient-roads</guid></item><item><title>地球升温速度比历史上任何时候都快</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/earth-is-heating-up-faster-than-at-any-time-in-its-history</link><description>比尔·麦奎尔说，为了了解气候变化的发展方向，我们必须回顾地球遥远的过去，并认识到我们所处的情况令人不安的独特性&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/earth-is-heating-up-faster-than-at-any-time-in-its-history.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:08:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/earth-is-heating-up-faster-than-at-any-time-in-its-history</guid></item><item><title>通过实验室培养的大脑探索自闭症</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/exploring-autism-through-lab-grown-brains</link><description>先驱研究人员分享了如何使用源自患者的大脑类器官来研究自闭症。这些模型揭示了疾病机制，并支持个性化自闭症治疗策略的开发。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/exploring-autism-through-lab-grown-brains.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:53:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/exploring-autism-through-lab-grown-brains</guid></item><item><title>“你的认知高峰不在20多岁”：一项具有里程碑意义的研究推翻了我们对大脑衰老的所有看法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/your-cognitive-peak-isnt-in-your-20s-a-landmark-study-just-demolished-everything-we-thought-about-brain-ageing</link><description>我们被告知，随着年龄的增长，智慧也会随之而来。但是保留回忆眼镜下落的能力吗？算了吧——至少我们是这么被告知的&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/your-cognitive-peak-isnt-in-your-20s-a-landmark-study-just-demolished-everything-we-thought-about-brain-ageing.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:38:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/your-cognitive-peak-isnt-in-your-20s-a-landmark-study-just-demolished-everything-we-thought-about-brain-ageing</guid></item><item><title>科学家制造了一种可编程芯片，可以根据命令减慢光速</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-built-a-programmable-chip-that-can-slow-light-on-command</link><description>新技术能够在单个光子芯片内存储、延迟和控制光，在人工智能服务器和下一代光通信系统的低功耗光计算中具有潜在的应用。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-built-a-programmable-chip-that-can-slow-light-on-command3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:23:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/scientists-built-a-programmable-chip-that-can-slow-light-on-command</guid></item><item><title>凯文·沃里克：成为/Come the Cy/Borg</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/kevin-warwick-be-come-the-cy-borg</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/kevin-warwick-be-come-the-cy-borg.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:08:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/kevin-warwick-be-come-the-cy-borg</guid></item><item><title>细菌簇可以弹出“逃生舱”以求生存</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/bacteria-clusters-can-eject-escape-pods-to-survive</link><description>寻找无需抗生素即可分解危险生物膜的潜在方法&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bacteria-clusters-can-eject-escape-pods-to-survive2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 11:53:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/bacteria-clusters-can-eject-escape-pods-to-survive</guid></item></channel></rss>